flowchart TD
    Start([Player Starts Game]) --> StratMode[Strategy Mode<br/>City Simulation]
    StratMode --> Monitor{Monitor R₀ & σ}
    Monitor -->|R₀ rising / σ dropping| Deploy[Deploy Intervention<br/>- Fact-Check Bureau<br/>- School MIL Program<br/>- Algorithm Audit<br/>- Community Dialog<br/>- Source Verification<br/>- Emergency Broadcast]
    Deploy --> SimTick[Simulation Tick<br/>ODE Engine Updates<br/>S/E/I/R + R₀ + σ]
    SimTick --> Check{Case Available?}
    Check -->|Yes| Transition[Mode Transition]
    Check -->|No| Monitor
    
    Transition --> DetMode[Detective Mode<br/>Investigative Forensics]
    DetMode --> Tools{Apply Tools}
    Tools -->|Spectrogram| Audio[Analyze Audio Artifacts]
    Tools -->|Frame Stepper| Video[Inspect Video Frame-by-Frame]
    Tools -->|Metadata Inspector| Meta[Extract EXIF, GPS, Timestamps]
    Tools -->|Source Tracer| Provenance[Trace Propagation Path]
    Tools -->|Inconsistency Highlighter| Visual[Detect Lighting/Shadow Anomalies]
    Tools -->|Timeline Cross-Referencer| Timeline[Cross-Reference Creation Time]
    
    Audio --> Connect[Connect Evidence Items<br/>Build Relationship Map]
    Video --> Connect
    Meta --> Connect
    Provenance --> Connect
    Visual --> Connect
    Timeline --> Connect
    
    Connect --> Verdict{Submit Verdict}
    Verdict -->|Real / Manipulated| Score[Scoring Engine<br/>Accuracy + Tools + Connections + Justification]
    Verdict -->|Uncertain| Score
    
    Score --> Results{Outcome}
    Results -->|Pass| Reward[Budget Bonus + R₀ Reduction + σ Boost]
    Results -->|Fail| Penalty[R₀ Increase + σ Drop]
    
    Reward --> StratMode
    Penalty --> StratMode
    
    Monitor -->|σ < 20<br/>σ-trap| GameOver[Game Over<br/>Coherence Collapsed]
    Monitor -->|R₀ > 2.0 for 40 ticks| GameOver
    StratMode -->|σ > 70, R₀ < 1.2<br/>3 cases solved| Victory[Victory<br/>City Saved!]
